Week1_Cloud_Foundations

Goal

Understand how the cloud actually works — from regions to IAM to billing.

Topics to Learn
	•	Virtualization and hypervisors.
	•	Regions and Availability Zones (redundancy & fault tolerance).
	•	Core services: compute, storage, networking, IAM.
	•	Pricing models and billing dashboards.

